          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse tidár slaqwaruusér kume gaa geerahat, nee ar tsiireero, tana amór Mose káy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose kuri báy, «Ataá sagadiyuuseerók mukduú slaqwara sleémeero ugwa faaraán, kudá' atén taa geeraharaharaán, naxés tam heé wák oo kaáhh i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta umuúqo heewo direne muruuwí nguna huúw tawa ilahhooár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Xooslaá sahaábu, nee himtaawe nee bangeélaywo, nee munga'aá baraá ditsa' ta layárár qamina, nee saaqaán nee kwasluuwo, adoodá' umuú heewo ngira sláy. Muruuwí ngun haniisaán as atén tiwa haraki/isárií tleehhi dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose nee kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari muruudá' sleémeero taa tleéhh ar sahaábu kuna ilaaóh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sahaábu sleémeero oo geeraharuusér slaqwaruusér kume nee ar tsiire aa hanís dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kílo tsiire tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala umuú slaqwarusmoowo haasaánguuwós guna ar tláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, Mose nee kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari sahaábudá' taa ilaaóh dír geeraharuuseedár slaqwaruusér kumér wa ale nee ar tsiire, kuri huúw baraá heémár Mungú as tawa gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gu inslawtamis daanduú múk Israeliwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
